| **Command**        | **What it does**                         |
| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |
| `ls -l`            | Displays file permissions and ownership. |
| `chmod 755 file`   | Changes file permissions.                |
| `chmod +x file`    | Makes a file executable.                 |
| `chown user file`  | Changes the file owner.                  |
| `chgrp group file` | Changes the file group.                  |
| `umask`            | Displays the default permission mask.    |
